/ActualText (Department of Computer Science and Engineering organized a workshop on R-PROGRAMMING for staff and faculty members on 18/10/2023 in the CSBS Lab. Dr. Praahas Amin was the resource person. He briefed about fundamentals of R environment, syntax to import and data manipulation using R. Also illustrated the data types used in R, arithmetic and logical operations with simple examples, generation of sequences and creation of vectors, creation of matrices from vectors using binding function, R Program on finding prime numbers by the method of Sieve of Eratosthenes using functions, developing R program for finding the Pearson and Spearman correlation coefficients.)
